graph TB
    A[Copy-on-Write COW] --> B[fork called]
    B --> C[Kernel duplicates page tables]
    C --> D[Mark all pages read-only]
    D --> E[Parent and child share physical pages]
    
    E --> F{Write to page?}
    F -->|No| G[Continue sharing - efficient!]
    F -->|Yes| H[Page fault triggered]
    
    H --> I[Kernel copies page]
    I --> J[Update page table]
    J --> K[Mark new page writable]
    K --> L[Resume execution]
    
    M[Benefits] --> M1[Fast fork ~1ms]
    M --> M2[Low memory overhead]
    M --> M3[Ideal for fork+exec]
    
    N[Example] --> N1["fork() - instant"]
    N1 --> N2[Parent modifies variable]
    N2 --> N3[Page fault + copy]
    N1 --> N4[Child never writes]
    N4 --> N5[Pages remain shared]
    
    style E fill:#e8f5e8
    style G fill:#d4edda
    style I fill:#fff4e1
